experience.description:
Directing Group security architecture for the most challenging cyber problems including:-
- using intelligence, analytics and orchestration for predictive and detective threat management;
- protecting very high value information from disclosure;
- securing an increasingly mobile workforce using smartphones, tablets and BYOD devices;
- accelerating safe and secure large scale transition to cloud hosting;
- strengthening kill chains for APT mitigation;
- integrating socio-technical-behavioural observables for insider threat mitigation;
- SCADA/Process automation system security (IT/OT convergence).
